{"s":[[null,1,[["p",["The Flat Topped Hat is a ",["l","帽子","hat"]," that can be ",["l","裁缝","tailored"]," using ",["l","布料","Cloth"]," and either a ",["l","红莓酱","Cranberry Sauce"]," or ",["l","塞料面包","Stuffing"]," at the sewing machine inside ",["l","柳巷2号","Emily's house"],", or the ",["l","缝纫机","Sewing Machine"]," received as a reward for the ",["l","任务","\"Rock Rejuvenation\""]," special order."]],["p",["There is a small chance to receive this hat from slaying ",["l","怪物","monsters"],", breaking ",["l","矿井","crates and barrels"],", chopping ",["l","树","trees"],", shaking trees with seeds, digging ",["l","远古斑点","Artifact Spot"],"s, or ",["l","淘盘","panning"],"."]]]],["Trivia",2,[["l",0,[[1,["This hat resembles a capotain, which is commonly associated with Pilgrims and Thanksgiving in the United States. The required tailoring ingredients, ",["l","红莓酱","Cranberry Sauce"]," and ",["l","塞料面包","Stuffing"],", are traditional Thanksgiving side dishes."]]]]]]]}